  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1302.01 “Bottom barrier” means a semi-permeable, fine mesh screening, laid over an area of sediments in a surface water to shade and physically inhibit plant growth.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1300) #8703-A, eff 9-5-06; ss by #10696, eff 10-18-14 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1300); ss by #14186, eff 1-25-25",
